Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:56.59,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Tenho vontade de correr pela multidão movimentada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:02.56,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k14}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}yo{\k16}bi{\k24}ko{\k26}n{\k21}da {\k15}mi{\k55}tai {\k100}ni {\k20}a{\k21}fu{\k48}re{\k37}te{\k21}ku {\kf161}arcade
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:02.56,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Elas enchem as ruas de novo, como se tivessem sido chamadas pra cá
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:07.44,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k19}{\be2\fad(150,150)}to{\k16}bi{\k20}ka{\k12}t{\k20}te{\k15}ru {\k23}go{\k15}hi{\k16}i{\k36}ki {\k88}ni {\k17}to{\k18}ku{\k15}i{\k20}ge {\k18}na {\k16}ji{\k37}bun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:07.44,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Ver todo mundo dizendo "Volte sempre!" me enche de orgulho
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:13.90,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k19}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}fu{\k12}ku{\k54}ran{\k16}da {\k17}ki{\k20}ta{\k41}i {\k98}ni {\k11}ha{\k26}sha{\k50}gi{\k36}ta{\k19}ku {\k36}na{\k139}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:13.90,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Com as expectativas crescendo, estou transbordando de empolgação
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:17.03,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k54}{\be2\fad(150,150)}pyon {\k50}to {\k37}ta{\k18}t{\k35}te{\k21}ta {\k44}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:17.03,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Ficando bem ereta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:19.53,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k34}{\be2\fad(150,150)}zu{\k19}t{\k51}to {\k37}ma{\k14}t{\k39}te{\k16}ta {\k18}no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:19.53,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Desculpe, fiz você esperar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:23.74,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k41}{\be2\fad(150,150)}su{\k17}re{\k18}chi{\k18}ga{\k8}u {\k24}so{\k73}no {\k16}e{\k52}gao {\k16}da{\k12}ki{\k25}shi{\k21}me{\k69}tai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:23.74,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quando vejo aqueles sorrisos passando, quero abraçá-los
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:24.87,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k42}{\be2\fad(150,150)}gyu{\k20}t{\k42}to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:24.87,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Bem apertado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:30.83,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k39}{\be2\fad(150,150)}oi{\k20}de{\k22} sa{\k16}a {\k24}mi{\k14}n{\k141}na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:30.83,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Entrem, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.54,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k13}{\k32}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ha{\k18}ji{\k37}ma{\k37}ri {\k151}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.54,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}O começo sempre chega,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:38.55,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k36}i{\k32}tsu{\k34}de{\k36}mo {\k20}kyu{\k33}u {\k89}ni {\k25}ha{\k44}shi{\k17}ri{\k38}da{\k81}su
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:38.55,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}De repente entro num sprint
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:41.72,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k26}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ma{\k9}ru {\k23}de {\k33}don{\k19}na {\k38}par{\k34}ty {\k116}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:41.72,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quase como se cada festa estivesse acontecendo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.60,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k44}{\k26}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ka{\k27}su{\k30}mu {\k41}you {\k119}na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.60,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Numa névoa brilhante
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:47.77,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k40}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ki{\k15}ra{\k16}me{\k32}ku {\k21}ba{\k19}sho {\k70}ne {\k20}ko{\k18}ko {\k50}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:47.77,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Não é tão iluminado aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:52.19,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}{\k20}ta{\k30}shi{\k22}ka{\k32}me{\k76}te{\k67}i{\k193}te
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:52.19,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Entre e dê uma olhada!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.59,0:03:08.29,Top,,0,0,0,,Então eu contei o número de clientes que passaram pelo distrito entre 10 e 11 da manhã.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.29,0:03:11.50,Top,,0,0,0,,Só 13 pessoas passaram pela Tamaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.20,Top,,0,0,0,,Que diabos você tá fazendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.20,0:03:15.18,Top,,0,0,0,,Você já terminou seu dever de casa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.18,0:03:16.54,Top,,0,0,0,,Fica quieto, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.54,0:03:20.39,Top,,0,0,0,,Não há gente suficiente passando por aqui!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.70,Top,,0,0,0,,Faz calor demais lá fora nessa época do ano, Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.70,0:03:27.27,Top,,0,0,0,,Ninguém quer sair quando está tão quente.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.27,0:03:31.02,Top,,0,0,0,,Por favor, dê uma olhada nos folhetos na sua frente.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.02,0:03:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei num plano pra enfrentar o calor deste verão!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.65,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs40\fnMarker SD\c&H191919&\frz3.443\pos(852.667,106.333)\b1}{right}Beat that Heat!!{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.65,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs40\fn#44 Font\c&H1DCD65&\frz13.01\pos(527.333,625)}{left}Shopping \NDistrict \NCampaign
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama-chan, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Natto?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.06,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.07,0:03:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,É um boneco de palha!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,De palha...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.35,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente devia fazer uma casa mal-assombrada neste verão!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma casa mal-assombrada?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.66,0:03:54.63,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(639,282)}Episode
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.66,0:03:54.63,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(639,282)}Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.66,0:03:54.63,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(640,482)} I Felt Chills Down My Spine Too
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.66,0:03:54.63,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(640,482)} I Felt Chills Down My Spine Too
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.29,0:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Também senti arrepios na espinha.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.93,0:03:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpem o atraso.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, vocês chegaram?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.70,0:04:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Por aqui!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que {\i1}você{\i0} está aqui?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Como se atreve a me falar desse jeito? Que falta de respeito!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vejo a Shiori-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está atrasada?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.93,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não vem. Ela tem acampamento com o clube de badminton.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.86,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,E o Ooji?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.72,0:04:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele também está no acampamento.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou bem triste por causa disso.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.98,0:04:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi. Coitado dele.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.22,0:04:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Enfim, anotei várias ideias que tive.
