Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ver!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.87,0:04:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, não consigo evitar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Não suporto pássaros.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela disse que não te suporta.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde vamos fazer isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O Bunny Baths disse que podemos usar o depósito deles.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Que ótimo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do que você tem medo, Dera-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Diz pra gente do que você tem medo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente pode colocar isso na casa assombrada!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.55,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é essa "casa assombrada" de que você fala?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não sabe o que é?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.12,0:04:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma casa assombrada.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma casa assombrada?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.78,0:04:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não explica nada...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Só um segundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei isso na Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.23,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, que grotesco.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera. Calma.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.24,0:05:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa "casa assombrada" é um lugar que você visita pra viver coisas assustadoras?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é castigo? Pra mim?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Castigo?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.06,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não é castigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.95,0:05:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não sente arrepios quando leva um susto?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,É divertido!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? Assustador é divertido?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.39,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me diga que você curte {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está insinuando?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.85,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Um bom susto pode te deixar mais ligado na vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim como uma ponte pênsil pode criar memórias.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Os corações das pessoas são estranhos e misteriosos.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.79,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Também vão ter crianças. Melhor a gente garantir que seja seguro.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,É. Temos que cuidar das crianças perdidas também.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Você quis dizer... desaparecidas?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.78,0:05:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só quis dizer aquilo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.36,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é bem comum.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Crianças desaparecendo, noite após noite.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, vamos, para!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tô só brincando.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não pareceu uma brincadeira!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.26,0:05:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa. O clima tava ali, eu não resisti.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mestre!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não ponha músicas macabras!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.59,0:06:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Não usamos isso desde a primavera.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso tá bom?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.50,0:06:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá perfeito!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, Kanna-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.09,0:06:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou medir.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma trena à mão!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.78,0:06:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.39,0:06:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ter que preencher.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.80,0:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Podemos fazer até mais do que planejamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.10,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.24,0:06:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cálculo concluído.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.36,0:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Se fizermos um percurso em M, vamos precisar de cerca de 200 caixas de papelão.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.97,0:06:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tantas?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.92,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Se precisar de caixas, eu resolvo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Atenção, lojistas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.48,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tama-chan precisa de caixas de papelão e outros materiais para o plano dela.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso conseguir mais se alguém precisar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.26,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.13,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei que vocês poderiam usar estas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiz cópias do panfleto.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.41,0:07:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vamos distribuir isso aos clientes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.02,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnTanuki Permanent Marker-CP\fs50\frz11.53\c&H131512&\b1\pos(423.999,121.143)}Venha visitar a\N casa assombrada!{\b0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda parece natto...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero ver a Shiori-san,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,mas não quero que ela ache que eu sou desse tipo também!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Devo dar isso pra ela?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.46,0:07:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou não devo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.31,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não! Isso é encrenca!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.87,Alternative,,0,0,0,,É, podemos estar em apuros.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.31,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá encrencada?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.54,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,É. Encrenca.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso fazer alguma coisa a respeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.53,0:07:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Realmente é um problema...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.27,0:07:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cadê o Dera?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.09,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está levando a Midori-chan e a Kanna-chan pra casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.62,0:07:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.46,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu queria que ele cuidasse do aviso circular!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.62,0:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, ora...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Flores de salgueiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas são flores de cerejeira.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.23,0:07:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cerejeiras fingindo ser salgueiros.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda são cerejeiras.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não servem, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,De verdade consegue atrair clientes com isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.72,0:07:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai vir, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.60,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.53,0:07:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Passa aqui! Vamos te dar três sustos!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, cinco!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.41,0:08:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Opaa, esqueci a toalha!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.45,0:08:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.85,0:08:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tô falando, eu os vi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá falando sério?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.05,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Completamente!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dois{\i0} espíritos sem corpo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.80,0:08:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não tava bêbada?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.52,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não bebo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sim. Velho chato.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fui só eu, não.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,O pessoal do Sashimi também viu algo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.85,0:08:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele típico assalariado...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Voltando do trabalho...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.05,0:08:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Coberto de sangue!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que isso está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.46,0:08:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sempre fomos um distrito de compras pacífico e afetuoso!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.63,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser uma maldição.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma maldição?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, para com isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.59,0:09:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Podemos chamar um padre pra abençoar o lugar, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, certo! A bênção!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém fez isso este ano?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.72,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunny Baths, alguém fez?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém fez!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.17,0:09:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.06,0:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá falando sério?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh não...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.72,0:09:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá brincando comigo!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,E vamos ter uma casa assombrada enquanto estamos amaldiçoados?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.44,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Monstros, espíritos, demônios e fantasmas!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos precisar de todos os exorcismos possíveis!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.66,0:09:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, isso as crianças estão fazendo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,E as crianças?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tamako?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo aqui, pai?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O certo, Tamako, nós temos—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.03,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não devemos contar pra ela.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.84,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei! E se a maldição alcançar minha Tama-chan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ela tava ansiosa pra ter isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer que eu a faça chorar?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.93,0:09:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente vai proteger a Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.14,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Proteger eu? Por quê?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.15,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Relaxa, não tem nada a ver com você!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.82,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,É, é isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ficar tranquila, Tama-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.74,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso foi rápido.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,E o seu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Só um segundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.29,0:10:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maldição...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.51,0:10:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você faz com isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Você crava pregos nisso.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.88,0:10:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Assustador, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.83,0:10:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, entendi. Você não consegue ver a mão no escuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.26,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que você entendeu errado.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.26,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama-chan, você tá aí?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.27,0:10:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouxe uns lanchinhos pra vocês!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, muito obrigada!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é... atum?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alho.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,É um alho muito bom.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Comam tudo, não deixem nada!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,E aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.82,0:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Que gracinha!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.72,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você não tem um vampiro, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.60,0:10:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que precisamos de um?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.98,0:10:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa! Tá perfeito!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.68,0:10:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, de qualquer forma, se cuida—aguenta aí!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.67,0:10:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.85,0:11:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouxemos uns lanchinhos e um pouco de cor pra você enquanto trabalha.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, obrigada!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.84,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Que horror!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.44,0:11:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouxe garrafas de saquê!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Que distraída!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.10,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não pode beber, você é menor!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas já que trouxe, que tal eu borrifar um pouco por aí.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Borrifar?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,E nas árvores também?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.41,0:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, e ali! A gente vai embora depois que eu borrifar lá.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos indo. Tchau!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheira a saquê...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Voltamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Como foi?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.79,0:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês tinham que ver minha atuação brilhante!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A próxima é...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.69,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não, não consigo...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça, e faça bem feito.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.74,0:11:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha filha e o bairro estão em jogo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente vem buscar seu corpo depois.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.89,0:11:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove que você é homem!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.81,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolação!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.73,0:11:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Como?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sal.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, é sal.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sal!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sal pra insolação!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.61,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você quer dizer?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que ele quer dizer que você pode ter insolação se não tiver sal suficiente.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,É isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,E aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.16,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Por mim é só.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.59,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Os lanchinhos que o pessoal traz aqui são meio esquisitos.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.69,0:12:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,É...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é bem gentil da parte deles.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.81,0:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse lugar até parece um altar de santuário agora.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.76,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{12:26 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.14,0:12:30.14,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\pos(1031,215)}Tamako Market
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.14,0:12:30.14,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.5\blur4\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\3c&H614867&\pos(1030,213)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 3,0:12:26.14,0:12:30.14,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HAA78E4&\pos(1029,211)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.14,0:12:30.14,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(1029,211)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako Market!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:30.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fs60\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\c&H8BE698&\b1\frz20.16\pos(170.286,198.286)}Maldito seja{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:30.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fs60\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\c&H8BE698&\b1\frz20.16\pos(170.286,198.286)}Maldito seja{\b0}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.35,0:12:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeu, como sempre.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouvi dizer que vocês vão abrir uma casa mal-assombrada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.97,0:12:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui está.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Volte sempre!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.24,0:12:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, vocês vão fazer uma casa mal-assombrada?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.47,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pretende visitar?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.56,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.51,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Só entre nós...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.94,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos um!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.96,0:13:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu limpo esse chão várias vezes, mas pegadas molhadas e fantasmagóricas continuam aparecendo!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos um!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Que estranho...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fry10\fax0.02\blur1\fnTanuki Permanent Marker-CP\c&H273C4A&\b1\frz327.6\pos(302.667,96.616)}Miyako Udon {\b0}{pick either top wooden signboard or the blue banner, both are the same}
