Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fay-0.09\fs48\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\pos(914.133,247.2)\b1\c&HB19F9F&}Soba   {\b0}{red sign, right of door}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.77,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Exatamente uma porção de udon está faltando...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem poderia ter...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.53,0:13:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me diga... a maldição!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Que calor...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora isso é bom.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing}Talvez só um minutinho dentro...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, meu Deus.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei tempo demais lá dentro.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As rosas...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As rosas floresceram sozinhas...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.91,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse distrito comercial...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.64,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,está...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,assombrado!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouvi dizer que aqui é mesmo assombrado.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:51.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.11\blur1.2\fs50\fnPaper Johnny Eins\pos(968.667,149)\c&HBFC0C1&}Saída {left 出口}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:51.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.11\blur1.2\fs50\fnPaper Johnny Eins\c&HBFC0C1&\pos(1154.33,164.667)}Entrada {right 入口}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.57,0:13:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegou sua parte?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.88,0:13:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, tô bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.92,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa tarde.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Shiori-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.42,0:13:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? Shiori-san?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-swa—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:01.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\an1\fnFansub Block\fscx3575\fscy592\c&HC85052&\pos(585.332,89.333)}A
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.02,0:14:01.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\1a&FF&\3a&70&\bord1\blur3\fs150\fnBrianne's hand\c&HEF90E6&\pos(986.668,107.999)}Casa {pink} {\b1\3a&120&\fnBoopee\b1\c&H3420D0&}Mal-assombrada {\b0}{Red}
