Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:01.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fs50\fnPaper Johnny Eins\c&HBFC0C1&\pos(1142.67,281.333)}Entrada {right 入口}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouxe alguns lanchinhos.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.77,0:14:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Delícia!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Essas são as croquetes da minha Shiori-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.93,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,É melhor você agradecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá, tá.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouvi dizer que vocês vão abrir uma casa mal-assombrada?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.10,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.02,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer experimentar?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.98,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá quase pronto.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa ideia.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.42,0:14:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisamos saber o que um cliente acharia.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesse caso...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.91,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me ofereço pra testar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.62,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal, Shiori-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.08,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouvi dizer que tem uma crença de que quem passa por uma casa mal-assombrada junto acaba se aproximando.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Que diabos?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.46,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu falei disso com ele outro dia.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.59,0:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não tenho problema em me aproximar de outra pessoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não me importo...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.73,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza, então tá decidido!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.85,0:14:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos amaldiçoar a Shiori-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maldição?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.44,0:14:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso! Vamos te amaldiçoar até o fim do mundo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Até o fim!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.93,0:14:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça o seu pior!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Truques bobos assim nunca vão abalar o amor entre mim e—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.91,0:15:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se assustou? Se assustou?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.02,0:15:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,É...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não parece muito assustada.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu fiquei.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o grito do pássaro foi a parte mais assustadora.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.80,0:15:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos montando uma casa mal-assombrada.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Toma, pega aí.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.98,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso pegar um também?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.14,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui está.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.94,0:15:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha conhecer a casa mal-assombrada da Bunny Mountain!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.02,0:15:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Garantimos um bom susto!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.31,0:15:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Que a casa mal-assombrada de hoje aconteça em segurança e tranquilamente!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.92,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\p1\pos(223.333,126.667)\c&HCC5B5A&}m 443 147 l 443 231 889 225 888 150 844 137 798 142 782 134 775 124 776 116 754 110 752 115 763 117 763 125 758 130 758 139 733 149 720 141 729 136 721 127 712 130 704 118 701 112 709 112 712 107 632 107 555 121 546 129 517 135 514 128
