Dialogue: 3,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.92,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs150\fnBrianne's hand\c&HEF90E6&\fscx52\fscy55\frx358\fry6\frz1.141\pos(677.335,234.666)}Casa {pink} {\fnBoopee\b1\c&H3420D0&}Mal-assombrada {\b0}{Red}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.92,Signs,,0,0,0,,Casa {pink} Mal-assombrada {Red}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Que diabos...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que isso é uma maldição?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.12,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Para com isso, Bunny Baths!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não acha que isso pode ser uma bênção?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma bênção?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos abrir em 20 minutos!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, aguardem mais um pouco!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que devemos avisar a Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.51,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai ser tarde demais se algo acontecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse lugar é mesmo assombrado, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.73,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantasmas de verdade, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.81,0:16:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem um minuto?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é assustador!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.14,0:16:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As almas sem corpo são assustadoras!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O funcionário de escritório é assustador!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.45,0:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso! As pegadas!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.12,0:16:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,E meu udon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.82,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,E minhas flores!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.41,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Este distrito comercial está assombrado!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.66,0:16:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não acredito!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.42,0:16:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo isso não é normal?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.25,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegadas deixadas num banho,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.88,0:16:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,ou faltar uma porção de udon por tê-la dado a gatos vadios,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,ou flores florescendo depois de serem tiradas do refrigerador.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.11,0:16:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Não são coisas totalmente normais?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.09,0:16:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela tá vestida como um fantasma, mas tá pensando com lógica!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora que penso nisso, é verdade...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Problemas resolvidos?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que sim...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Shiori-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.22,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora podemos tocar a casa mal-assombrada sem problemas!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.26,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa é a minha Shiori-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.22,0:16:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,E as almas sem corpo e o funcionário de escritório, então?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\p1\pos(223.333,126.667)\c&HBB5B71&}m 443 147 l 443 231 889 225 888 150 844 137 798 142 782 134 775 124 776 116 754 110 752 115 763 117 763 125 758 130 758 139 733 149 720 141 729 136 721 127 712 130 704 118 701 112 709 112 712 107 632 107 555 121 546 129 517 135 514 128
